      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like the lack of agency and control is causing you the most profound distress right now. Feeling that the system dictates every part of your existence is an exhausting and terrifying feeling. While the current job feels inescapable, there are small ways to reclaim a sense of personal control, even if it's just in how you spend your free time. Reaching out to a counselor could help you begin identifying small, personal areas where you can start exercising your own decisions.",
      "source": "target",
